  "body": "Especially for strategy games it would be useful to keep the cursor inside the fullscreen window to not lose focus when using multiple screens.\r\n\r\nThe Pointer Lock API has a use case for this: https://w3c.github.io/pointerlock/#xview-port-panning-by-moving-a-mouse-cursor-against-the-bounds-of-a-view-port. This would involve letting the game render the cursor by itself, introducing latency which is unacceptable for gaming.",
